ing </c><00:00:01.698><c>effective </c><00:00:01.700><c>these </c><00:00:01.702><c>techniques </c><00:00:01.704><c>are  </c><00:00:01.706><c>expensive </c><00:00:01.708><c>and </c><00:00:01.710><c>not </c><00:00:01.712><c>widely </c><00:00:01.714><c>used  </c><00:00:01.716><c>after </c><00:00:01.718><c>treatment </c><00:00:01.720><c>the </c><00:00:01.722><c>newly </c><00:00:01.724><c>cleaned </c><00:00:01.726><c>water  </c><00:00:01.728><c>will </c><00:00:01.730><c>go </c><00:00:01.732><c>out </c><00:00:01.734><c>into </c><00:00:01.736><c>the </c><00:00:01.738><c>world </c><00:00:01.740><c>perhaps </c><00:00:01.742><c>to </c><00:00:01.744><c>an  </c><00:00:01.746><c>ocean </c><00:00:01.748><c>or </c><00:00:01.750><c>to </c><00:00:01.752><c>a </c><00:00:01.754><c>river </c><00:00:01.756><c>or </c><00:00:01.758><c>maybe </c><00:00:01.760><c>even </c><00:00:01.762><c>into  </c><00:00:01.764><c>rubik's </c><00:00:01.766><c>next </c><00:00:01.768><c>bath</c>

